mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 598px;" border="1" width="627">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 583px;" width="627">
<table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584px; height: 5420px;" border="1" width="577">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 26px; text-align: center; height: 54px;" width="60">
<p>周</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 18px; text-align: center; height: 54px;" width="47">
<p>星期</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 401px; text-align: center; height: 54px;" width="384">
<p>内容</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 72px; text-align: center; height: 54px;" width="85">
<p>授课教师</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 26px; text-align: center; height: 252px;" rowspan="2" width="60">
<p>1</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 18px; height: 137px;" width="47">
<p>一</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 401px; height: 137px;" width="384">
<p>教学内容：绪论、药物的体内过程</p>
<p>教学目标：了解药物的概念，药物与毒物的界限。我国“本草”的贡献，我国药理学科研成就，国外药理 学的发展简史与远景;掌握药动学吸收、分布、代谢、排泄的概念及特点。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 72px; height: 137px;" width="85">
<p>&nbsp; 沈晓燕</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 18px; height: 115px;" width="47">
<p>三</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 401px; height: 115px;" width="384">
<p>教学内容：药物代谢动力学</p>
<p>教学目标：掌握一级动力学、零级动力学的特点；掌握影响药动学的因素、血药浓度的动态变化和主要药动学参数的概念和临床意义;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 72px; height: 115px;" width="85">
<p>&nbsp; 沈晓燕</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 26px; height: 306px;" rowspan="3" width="60">
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">2</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 18px; height: 137px;" width="47">
<p>一</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 401px; height: 137px;" width="384">
<p>教学内容：药物效应动力学</p>
<p>教学目标：掌握药物作用、不良反应、受体、激动药、拮抗药、效能、效价等概念；掌握量-效关系的概念及其意义；了解影响药物作用的因素。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 72px; height: 137px;" width="85">
<p>&nbsp; 沈晓燕</p>
</td>
</tr>
